Umuman qisqartirmoqchiman.

228
00:12:11,077 --> 00:12:13,416
Tozalik berib, qisqartiring.

229
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:15,440
Tushunarli.

230
00:12:15,462 --> 00:12:19,196
Yon tomonlar va orqasini qisqa qilib olamanmi?

231
00:12:19,219 --> 00:12:22,419
Ha, qisqartiring.

232
00:12:22,442 --> 00:12:25,499
Mashinka ishlatsam bo’ladimi?

233
00:12:25,522 --> 00:12:28,569
Ha, muammo yo’q.

234
00:12:28,592 --> 00:12:30,592
Tushunarib oldim.

235
00:12:30,615 --> 00:12:33,482
Old sochlaringizni qanday qilay?

236
00:12:33,505 --> 00:12:37,105
Qoshlaringizga tegmaydigan qilib oling.

237
00:12:37,128 --> 00:12:38,928
Tushunarli.

238
00:12:38,951 --> 00:12:42,685
Odatda sochlaringizga stil berish uchun nima ishlatasiz?

239
00:12:42,708 --> 00:12:46,554
Ha, har ertalab mum (vaks) ishlataman.

240
00:12:46,578 --> 00:12:48,578
Tushunarli.

241
00:12:48,601 --> 00:12:52,267
Sochingizni osongina tarash uchun qilib kesaman.

242
00:12:52,290 --> 00:12:53,973
Rahmat.

243
00:12:53,997 --> 00:12:55,674
Juda yaxshi bo‘ladi.

244
00:12:55,697 --> 00:12:58,752
Bugun ishda dam olmoqdasizmi?

245
00:12:58,776 --> 00:13:02,853
Ha, bugun ishda dam olaman.

246
00:13:02,876 --> 00:13:05,876
Dam olish kunlarida odatda nima qilasiz?

247
00:13:05,899 --> 00:13:10,187
Bog‘da sayr qilaman, kafega boraman.

248
00:13:10,211 --> 00:13:11,977
Yaxshi fikr!

249
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:15,835
Bu yaqinlarda juda mazali kofelar bor.

250
00:13:15,859 --> 00:13:17,713
Rostdanmi?

251
00:13:17,736 --> 00:13:20,070
Keyinroq borib ko‘rmoqchiman.

252
00:13:20,093 --> 00:13:23,946
Endi avval boshni yuvamiz.

253
00:13:23,970 --> 00:13:27,703
Shu tomondagi shampun stoli tomon sizni kuzatib boraman.

254
00:13:27,726 --> 00:13:29,859
Ha, tushunarli.

255
00:13:29,882 --> 00:13:32,116
Iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

256
00:13:32,139 --> 00:13:33,639
7-Sahna: Kutubxona foydalanuvchi kartasini olish

257
00:13:33,639 --> 00:13:35,572
Uzr, iltimos.

258
00:13:35,595 --> 00:13:38,397
Bu yerga birinchi marta keldim.

259
00:13:38,421 --> 00:13:39,989
Xush kelibsiz!

260
00:13:40,012 --> 00:13:42,786
Kutubxonamizga xush kelibsiz!

261
00:13:42,809 --> 00:13:47,043
Kitob olishni xohlayman, lekin kartam yo‘q.

262
00:13:47,066 --> 00:13:49,032
Tushunarib oldim.

263
00:13:49,055 --> 00:13:52,033
Foydalanuvchi kartasini chiqaramiz.

264
00:13:52,057 --> 00:13:54,473
Qanday qilib chiqarish mumkin?

265
00:13:54,496 --> 00:13:59,031
Bu anketaga ismingiz va manzilingizni yozing.

266
00:13:59,055 --> 00:14:00,889
Tushunarli.

267
00:14:00,912 --> 00:14:03,209
Shu yerga yozaman.

268
00:14:03,232 --> 00:14:05,101
Rahmat.

269
00:14:05,125 --> 00:14:09,178
Manzilingizni ko‘rsatadigan shaxsiy guvohnoma bormi?

270
00:14:09,201 --> 00:14:13,001
Ha, yashash kartam bor.

271
00:14:13,024 --> 00:14:14,881
Ko‘rsatib bering.

272
00:14:14,905 --> 00:14:17,556
Ha, tasdiqlandi.

273
00:14:17,579 --> 00:14:20,146
Kartangizni beraman.

274
00:14:20,169 --> 00:14:22,183
Rahmat.

275
00:14:22,206 --> 00:14:25,489
Bir marta nechta kitob olish mumkin?

276
00:14:25,513 --> 00:14:28,889
Bir marta beshtagacha kitob olish mumkin.

277
00:14:28,913 --> 00:14:31,846
Qaytargan muddat qancha?

278
00:14:31,869 --> 00:14:35,088
Qaytargan muddat ikki hafta.

279
00:14:35,111 --> 00:14:38,045
Ikki hafta ichida qaytarib qo‘ying.

280
00:14:38,068 --> 00:14:39,901
Tushunarli.

281
00:14:39,924 --> 00:14:43,742
Tinch o‘rganish uchun joy bormi?

282
00:14:43,766 --> 00:14:48,582
Ha, ikkinchi qavatda tinch o‘rganish joyi bor.

283
00:14:48,605 --> 00:14:51,372
Kompyuterdan foydalanish mumkinmi?

284
00:14:51,395 --> 00:14:55,771
Ha, kompyuter ishlatish mumkin bo‘lgan joylar ham bor.

285
00:14:55,795 --> 00:14:58,561
Bu juda yordam beradi.

286
00:14:58,584 --> 00:15:01,988
Bunday aniq tushuntirib berganingiz uchun rahmat.

287
00:15:02,012 --> 00:15:05,345
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

288
00:15:05,368 --> 00:15:08,535
Marhamat, sekin-asta dam oling.

289
00:15:08,558 --> 00:15:10,058
8-Sahna: Sport zaliga birinchi tashrif: Salomlashish va maqsadlar

290
00:15:10,058 --> 00:15:11,466
Salom.

291
00:15:11,490 --> 00:15:14,890
Bugundan boshlab iltimos qilaman.

292
00:15:14,913 --> 00:15:16,279
Salom.

293
00:15:16,302 --> 00:15:18,918
Men ham sizga iltimos qilaman.

294
00:15:18,942 --> 00:15:22,399
Bugun sport zalidan foydalanish birinchi marta mi?

295
00:15:22,423 --> 00:15:23,709
Ha.

296
00:15:23,733 --> 00:15:25,982
Bugun birinchi marta.

297
00:15:26,006 --> 00:15:28,606
A’zo bo‘lganingiz uchun rahmat.

298
00:15:28,629 --> 00:15:32,162
Sport zaliga kelish maqsadingiz nima?

299
00:15:32,185 --> 00:15:36,385
Yaqinda ish tufayli harakat yetishmay qoldi.

300
00:15:36,408 --> 00:15:38,774
Jismoniy kuchni oshirmoqchiman.

301
00:15:38,797 --> 00:15:41,331
Ajoyib maqsad ekan!

302
00:15:41,354 --> 00:15:43,570
Birga harakat qilaylik!

303
00:15:43,593 --> 00:15:44,931
Ha.

304
00:15:44,954 --> 00:15:46,788
Iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

305
00:15:46,811 --> 00:15:51,499
Avvalo, yugurish mashinasining ishlatilishini tushuntirib beraman.

306
00:15:51,522 --> 00:15:53,322
Bu yerga keling.

307
00:15:53,346 --> 00:15:55,631
Ha, tushunarli.

308
00:15:55,654 --> 00:16:00,504
Bu yashil tugmani bosganda, mashina harakatlana boshlaydi.

309
00:16:00,528 --> 00:16:03,540
Tezlikni shu yerda oʻzgartirish mumkin.

310
00:16:03,563 --> 00:16:05,996
Tugmani bosish kerak ekan, shundaymi?

311
00:16:06,019 --> 00:16:09,019
Boshida sekin yuguramiz.

312
00:16:09,042 --> 00:16:10,409
Ha.

313
00:16:10,432 --> 00:16:14,799
Avval oʻn besh daqiqa atrofida piyoda yurishdan boshlaymiz.

314
00:16:14,822 --> 00:16:19,303
Ahvolingiz yomonlashsa, qizil tugmani bosing.

315
00:16:19,326 --> 00:16:21,092
Tushunarli.

316
00:16:21,115 --> 00:16:23,715
Qizil tugma bilan mashina toʻxtaydi, shundaymi?

317
00:16:23,738 --> 00:16:28,072
Keyin, mushak mashq qilish uskunalarini koʻrsatib beraman.

318
00:16:28,095 --> 00:16:30,828
Bu oyoq harakati uchun moʻljallangan mashina.

319
00:16:30,851 --> 00:16:33,651
Oyoq mushaklarimni ham mustahkamlashni xohlayman.

320
00:16:33,674 --> 00:16:36,485
Ogʻirlikni shu yerda sozlash mumkin.

321
00:16:36,509 --> 00:16:40,042
Boshida yengil ogʻirlikdan boshlaymiz.

322
00:16:40,065 --> 00:16:41,742
Tushunarli.

323
00:16:41,766 --> 00:16:44,332
5 kilogrammga sozlaymiz.

324
00:16:44,355 --> 00:16:48,850
Oʻzingizga mos sur’atda, zoʻr bermay mashq qiling.

325
00:16:48,874 --> 00:16:50,641
Rahmat.

326
00:16:50,664 --> 00:16:53,697
Har kuni oz-ozdan harakat qilaman.

327
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:57,994
Terlaganingizda, suv iste’mol qilib turing.

328
00:16:58,018 --> 00:17:00,792
Suv olish joyi u yerda.

329
00:17:00,815 --> 00:17:02,782
Tushunarli.

330
00:17:02,805 --> 00:17:05,384
Mashq qilayotganda suv ichaman.

331
00:17:05,408 --> 00:17:09,741
Nimadir tushunmagan boʻlsangiz, xodimlarga har vaqt soʻrashingiz mumkin.

332
00:17:09,764 --> 00:17:11,497
Rahmat.

333
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:13,819
Juda ham xotirjam boʻldim.

334
00:17:13,843 --> 00:17:17,282
Endi, zavqlanib mashq qiling!

335
00:17:17,305 --> 00:17:18,515
Ha.

336
00:17:18,539 --> 00:17:20,072
Harakat qilaman!

337
00:17:20,095 --> 00:17:21,595
9-Sahna: Tanishuv va oʻz taqdimoti

338
00:17:21,595 --> 00:17:26,362
Salom, men Dizayn boʻlimidan Yamada.

339
00:17:26,385 --> 00:17:31,468
Salom, men Savdo boʻlimidan Sato.

340
00:17:31,491 --> 00:17:34,364
Bugun sizga ishonaman.

341
00:17:34,388 --> 00:17:37,835
Men ham sizga iltimos qilaman.

342
00:17:37,858 --> 00:17:42,059
Sato-san, siz kompaniyaga qachon kirgansiz?

343
00:17:42,083 --> 00:17:46,489
Men bu yilning aprel oyida ishga kirdim.

344
00:17:46,512 --> 00:17:50,388
A, yangi xodimsiz, shundaymi?

345
00:17:50,411 --> 00:17:54,644
Ha, hali biroz oʻrganib olganim yoʻq.

346
00:17:54,667 --> 00:17:58,201
Men esa ishga kirganimning ikkinchi yilidaman.

347
00:17:58,224 --> 00:18:02,042
A, siz meni oldingisiz.

348
00:18:02,065 --> 00:18:05,080
Yoʻq, yoʻq, hali koʻp narsani oʻrganishim kerak.

349
00:18:05,104 --> 00:18:08,160
Savdo boʻlimidagi ishlar qanday?

350
00:18:08,183 --> 00:18:13,017
Savdo boʻlimidagi ishlar har kuni band.

351
00:18:13,041 --> 00:18:16,109
Lekin juda ham qiziqarli.

352
00:18:16,132 --> 00:18:18,573
Bu juda yaxshi.

353
00:18:18,597 --> 00:18:21,797
Hozir nima ichyapsiz?

354
00:18:21,820 --> 00:18:25,518
Hozir men ulung choy ichyapman.

355
00:18:25,541 --> 00:18:29,175
Men sovuq apelsin sharbati ichyapman.

356
00:18:29,198 --> 00:18:33,431
Sato-san, dam olish kunlarida nima qilasiz?

357
00:18:33,454 --> 00:18:38,054
Men dam olish kunlarida futbol oʻynayman.

358
00:18:38,077 --> 00:18:41,044
Bogʻda doʻstlarim bilan sport qilamiz.

359
00:18:41,067 --> 00:18:43,067
Yamada-san, siz-chi?

360
00:18:43,090 --> 00:18:47,466
Men uyda kino koʻrishni yaxshi koʻraman.

361
00:18:47,489 --> 00:18:51,026
Anime va yapon filmlarini koʻp tomosha qilaman.

362
00:18:51,049 --> 00:18:53,947
Men ham anime yoqtiraman.

363
00:18:53,970 --> 00:18:57,613
Iltimos, keyingi safar tavsiya qiladigan filmingizni aytib bering.

364
00:18:57,637 --> 00:19:00,412
Ha, xushchaqchaq.

365
00:19:00,435 --> 00:19:07,235
Aytgancha, savdo boʻlimi va dizayn boʻlimi baʼzan birgalikda ishlashadi, shunday emasmi?

366
00:19:07,258 --> 00:19:12,825
Ha, yangi bukletni birgalikda tayyorlashimizni eshitdim.

367
00:19:12,848 --> 00:19:16,226
Ha, shu kunni intizorlik bilan kutaman.

368
00:19:16,250 --> 00:19:20,117
Keyinroq ofisda yana gaplashamiz, rozi boʻlsangiz.

369
00:19:20,140 --> 00:19:22,340
Ha, rahmat.

370
00:19:22,363 --> 00:19:25,199
Bundan buyon yaxshi hamkorlik qilaylik.

371
00:19:25,222 --> 00:19:29,589
Ha, men ham siz bilan yaxshi hamkorlik qilishni istayman.

372
00:19:29,611 --> 00:19:31,111
10-Sahna: Itlar bilan tanishish va ularni sayrga chiqarish

373
00:19:31,111 --> 00:19:35,478
Salom. Qanday yoqimtoy it!

374
00:19:35,501 --> 00:19:37,634
Salom. Rahmat.

375
00:19:37,657 --> 00:19:40,991
Bu it qaysi zot?

376
00:19:41,014 --> 00:19:43,547
Shiba inu.

377
00:19:43,570 --> 00:19:46,629
Ismi Hachi.

378
00:19:46,653 --> 00:19:48,886
Hachi-chan desangiz.

379
00:19:48,910 --> 00:19:50,983
Necha yoshda?

380
00:19:51,006 --> 00:19:53,240
2 yoshda.

381
00:19:53,262 --> 00:19:56,722
Sizning itingizning ismi nima?

382
00:19:56,746 --> 00:20:00,430
Mening itim Choko deb ataladi.

383
00:20:00,453 --> 00:20:02,686
Oy poodle.

384
00:20:02,709 --> 00:20:05,276
Choko-chan desangiz.

385
00:20:05,299 --> 00:20:07,133
Necha yoshda?

386
00:20:07,157 --> 00:20:09,723
3 yoshda.

387
00:20:09,746 --> 00:20:13,379
Har doim shu vaqtda sayrga chiqasizmi?

388
00:20:13,402 --> 00:20:14,869
Ha.

389
00:20:14,892 --> 00:20:18,459
Har ertalab soat 7 atrofida bu yerga kelamiz.

390
00:20:18,482 --> 00:20:22,750
Men ham har ertalab soat 7da sayr qilaman.

391
00:20:22,773 --> 00:20:26,906
Endi tez-tez uchrashishimiz mumkin.

392
00:20:26,929 --> 00:20:28,899
Ha, shunday!

393
00:20:28,923 --> 00:20:34,956
Kechirasiz, yaqin atrofda tavsiya qiladigan veterinariya shifoxonasini bilasizmi?

394
00:20:34,979 --> 00:20:36,413
Ha.

395
00:20:36,436 --> 00:20:41,085
Bekat yaqinida „Sakura“ hayvonlar shifoxonasi bor.

396
00:20:41,109 --> 00:20:44,542
Shifokorlar juda mehribon.

397
00:20:44,565 --> 00:20:46,440
Shundaymi?

398
00:20:46,464 --> 00:20:49,530
Aytib berganingiz uchun rahmat.

399
00:20:49,553 --> 00:20:53,242
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

400
00:20:53,266 --> 00:20:56,833
Bu yaqinlarda itlar uchun yugurish maydonchasi ham bor.

401
00:20:56,856 --> 00:21:00,389
Rostdanmi? Qayerda?

402
00:21:00,412 --> 00:21:02,249
Borib koʻrmoqchiman.

403
00:21:02,273 --> 00:21:06,506
Parkning sharqiy kirish qismi yaqinida.

404
00:21:06,529 --> 00:21:09,296
Katta maysazor bor.

405
00:21:09,319 --> 00:21:11,519
Shundaymi?

406
00:21:11,542 --> 00:21:13,956
Navbatda borib koʻraman.

407
00:21:13,979 --> 00:21:17,412
Ha, albatta borib koʻring.

408
00:21:17,435 --> 00:21:20,969
Endi ketishim kerak.

409
00:21:20,991 --> 00:21:22,604
Ha.

410
00:21:22,628 --> 00:21:25,161
Bugun uchun rahmat.

411
00:21:25,184 --> 00:21:28,866
Arzimaydi. Yana koʻrishguncha.

412
00:21:28,890 --> 00:21:30,290
Ha.

413
00:21:30,313 --> 00:21:32,980
Yana yaxshi hamkorlik qilamiz.

414
00:21:33,003 --> 00:21:34,503
11-Sahna: Joy tasdiqlash va suhbatlashish uchun asosiy yaponcha iboralar

415
00:21:34,503 --> 00:21:36,346
Uzr, iltimos.

416
00:21:36,369 --> 00:21:39,614
Bu joy boʻshmi?

417
00:21:39,638 --> 00:21:42,471
Ha, boʻsh.

418
00:21:42,494 --> 00:21:44,774
Iltimos, oʻtiring.

419
00:21:44,798 --> 00:21:46,446
Rahmat.

420
00:21:46,469 --> 00:21:49,636
Shu yerga oʻtiraman.

421
00:21:49,660 --> 00:21:52,226
Bugun ob-havo juda yaxshi, shunday emasmi?

422
00:21:52,249 --> 00:21:54,907
Bu yerga tez-tez tashrif buyurasizmi?

423
00:21:54,931 --> 00:21:58,735
Yo'q, birinchi marta keldim.

424
00:21:58,759 --> 00:22:01,815
Bu joy juda chiroyli ekan.

425
00:22:01,838 --> 00:22:03,471
Ha, rostdan ham.

426
00:22:03,494 --> 00:22:07,028
Bu yer tinch, ish qilish oson.

427
00:22:07,051 --> 00:22:10,884
Wi-Fi paroli qayerda?

428
00:22:10,907 --> 00:22:14,840
U stol ustidagi karta(ga) qarang.

429
00:22:14,863 --> 00:22:17,335
U yerda yozilgan.

430
00:22:17,359 --> 00:22:19,759
A, rostdan ham.

431
00:22:19,782 --> 00:22:21,382
Rahmat.

432
00:22:21,405 --> 00:22:24,971
Bepul ichimlik bormi?

433
00:22:24,994 --> 00:22:28,127
Ha, u yerda bor.

434
00:22:28,150 --> 00:22:30,609
Qahva va choy bor.

435
00:22:30,633 --> 00:22:33,072
Yaxshi ekan.

436
00:22:33,096 --> 00:22:36,576
Keyinroq ichimlik olishga boraman.

437
00:22:36,599 --> 00:22:40,332
Siz qanday ish bilan shug'ullanasiz?

438
00:22:40,355 --> 00:22:43,322
Men veb-yozuvchiman.

439
00:22:43,345 --> 00:22:46,011
Kompyuterda maqolalar yozaman.

440
00:22:46,034 --> 00:22:48,168
Shundaymi?

441
00:22:48,191 --> 00:22:51,391
Men dasturchiman.

442
00:22:51,414 --> 00:22:53,309
Ajoyib ekan!

443
00:22:53,332 --> 00:22:56,599
Dasturlash ishlari qiyinmi?

444
00:22:56,622 --> 00:23:01,227
Ba’zida qiyin, lekin qiziqarli.

445
00:23:01,250 --> 00:23:03,133
Shundaymi?

446
00:23:03,157 --> 00:23:05,893
Bir-birimizga omad tilaymiz, ishga kirishamiz!

447
00:23:05,916 --> 00:23:08,890
Ha, omad tilaymiz!

448
00:23:08,914 --> 00:23:12,680
Endi ishni boshlaymiz.

449
00:23:12,703 --> 00:23:15,740
Ha, marhamat, o'zizni qulay his qiling.

450
00:23:15,764 --> 00:23:17,264
12-Sahna: Birinchi uchrashuv suhbati / First Meeting Conversations

451
00:23:17,264 --> 00:23:19,304
Tanishganimdan xursandman.

452
00:23:19,327 --> 00:23:21,894
Bu yerga o'tirib olsam bo'ladimi?

453
00:23:21,917 --> 00:23:23,894
Tanishganimdan xursandman.

454
00:23:23,918 --> 00:23:26,355
Ha, iltimos.

455
00:23:26,378 --> 00:23:28,145
Rahmat.

456
00:23:28,168 --> 00:23:30,568
Meni Anna deb chaqirishadi.

457
00:23:30,591 --> 00:23:32,462
Iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

458
00:23:32,485 --> 00:23:34,885
Men Kenman.

459
00:23:34,908 --> 00:23:38,242
Men ham, iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

460
00:23:38,265 --> 00:23:41,401
Ken, siz qayerdansiz?

461
00:23:41,424 --> 00:23:44,090
Avstraliyadanman.

462
00:23:44,114 --> 00:23:46,683
Mening ona tilim ingliz tili.

463
00:23:46,706 --> 00:23:48,306
Shundaymi?

464
00:23:48,329 --> 00:23:51,421
Men Ispaniyadanman.

465
00:23:51,444 --> 00:23:53,857
Mening ona tilim ispan tili.

466
00:23:53,881 --> 00:23:57,769
Hozir yapon tilini o'rganyapman.

467
00:23:57,792 --> 00:24:00,959
Men ham yapon tilini o'rganmoqchiman.

468
00:24:00,982 --> 00:24:04,155
Birgalikda yapon tilida gaplashamiz!

469
00:24:04,179 --> 00:24:06,245
Ha, rahmat.

470
00:24:06,269 --> 00:24:10,436
Anna, siz nega Yaponiyaga keldingiz?

471
00:24:10,459 --> 00:24:14,193
Yapon animelari va taomlarini yaxshi ko'rganim uchun.

472
00:24:14,216 --> 00:24:16,696
Qaysi anime yoqadi?

473
00:24:16,719 --> 00:24:19,521
Kino animelarini yaxshi ko'raman.

474
00:24:19,544 --> 00:24:23,121
Ken, siz yapon taomlarini yaxshi ko'rasizmi?

475
00:24:23,145 --> 00:24:27,321
Ha, ramen va sushini juda yaxshi ko'raman.

476
00:24:27,344 --> 00:24:31,978
Avstraliyada mazali taomlar bormi?

477
00:24:32,001 --> 00:24:37,139
Ha, toza dengiz va mazali go'sht taomlari bor.

478
00:24:37,162 --> 00:24:38,839
Yaxshi fikr!

479
00:24:38,862 --> 00:24:42,158
Bir kun Avstraliyaga borishni xohlayman.

480
00:24:42,182 --> 00:24:44,276
Albatta, keling!

481
00:24:44,299 --> 00:24:48,183
… Anna, sizning yapon tilingiz juda yaxshi ekan.

482
00:24:48,207 --> 00:24:49,782
Rahmat.

483
00:24:49,805 --> 00:24:53,238
Lekin, ko'proq mashq qilmoqchiman.

484
00:24:53,261 --> 00:24:57,338
Bugun yapon tilida ko'p gaplashib, juda qiziq boldi.

485
00:24:57,361 --> 00:24:59,495
Yana shu yerda uchrashamiz.

486
00:24:59,518 --> 00:25:02,384
Ha, yana uchrashamiz!

487
00:25:02,407 --> 00:25:04,607
Rahmat.

488
00:25:04,630 --> 00:25:06,130
13-Sahnа: Oshxona darsining birinchi kuni / Birinchi marta oshxona darsida

489
00:25:06,130 --> 00:25:10,497
Assalomu alaykum, bugun iltimos qilaman.

490
00:25:10,520 --> 00:25:13,920
Assalomu alaykum, iltimos.

491
00:25:13,943 --> 00:25:16,743
Meni Kim deb chaqirishadi.

492
00:25:16,766 --> 00:25:19,299
Men Tanaka.

493
00:25:19,323 --> 00:25:22,925
Bu oshxona stoli juda keng ekan.

494
00:25:22,949 --> 00:25:24,767
Ha, rostdan ham.

495
00:25:24,790 --> 00:25:27,723
Foydalanish juda qulay.

496
00:25:27,746 --> 00:25:31,791
Kim san, oshxona darsiga birinchi marta kelyapsanmi?

497
00:25:31,815 --> 00:25:35,348
Ha, bugun birinchi kunim.

498
00:25:35,371 --> 00:25:37,850
Biroz asabiy bo'lyapman.

499
00:25:37,874 --> 00:25:40,212
Hech qisiq emas.

500
00:25:40,236 --> 00:25:42,869
O'qituvchi juda mehribon.

501
00:25:42,892 --> 00:25:46,425
Tanaka san, tez-tez kelasanmi?

502
00:25:46,448 --> 00:25:50,415
Yo'q, men ham o'tgan oydan boshladim.

503
00:25:50,438 --> 00:25:54,638
Kim san, nega oshxona darsiga kelding?

504
00:25:54,661 --> 00:25:59,299
Men o'tgan oydan mustaqil yashay boshladim.

505
00:25:59,323 --> 00:26:03,094
O'zim uchun mazali taomlar pishirmoqchiman.

506
00:26:03,117 --> 00:26:05,250
Ajoyib!

507
00:26:05,273 --> 00:26:08,507
Uyda tez-tez ovqat pishirasizmi?

508
00:26:08,530 --> 00:26:11,896
Yo'q, hali unchalik qila olmayman.

509
00:26:11,919 --> 00:26:15,355
Faqat oddiy sho'rva tayyorlay olaman.

510
00:26:15,379 --> 00:26:17,237
Shundaymi?

511
00:26:17,260 --> 00:26:21,100
Bugungi menyu go'shtli kartoshka ekan, shundaymi?

512
00:26:21,124 --> 00:26:24,790
Ha, yapon taomlarining asosi.

513
00:26:24,813 --> 00:26:27,180
Juda qiziqib kutyapman.

514
00:26:27,203 --> 00:26:30,736
Kartoshka va mol go'shtidan foydalanamiz, shundaymi?

515
00:26:30,759 --> 00:26:32,132
Ha.

516
00:26:32,156 --> 00:26:36,794
A, o'qituvchi endi keladi.

517
00:26:36,817 --> 00:26:40,632
Fartuk taqing va qo'llaringizni toza yuving.

518
00:26:40,655 --> 00:26:42,889
Ha, to'g'ri.

519
00:26:42,912 --> 00:26:45,354
Birga harakat qilaylik!

520
00:26:45,377 --> 00:26:48,348
Ha, omad tilaymiz!

521
00:26:48,371 --> 00:26:49,871
14-Sahnа: Birinchi ko'ngilli faoliyat kuni / Birinchi marta ko'ngilli bo'lib

522
00:26:49,871 --> 00:26:54,871
Assalomu alaykum, bugundan boshlab ko'ngilli faoliyatda ishtirok etaman.

523
00:26:54,894 --> 00:26:57,028
Tanaka.

524
00:26:57,051 --> 00:27:01,388
Assalomu alaykum, ko'ngilli Sato.

525
00:27:01,412 --> 00:27:03,812
Iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

526
00:27:03,835 --> 00:27:06,036
Iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

527
00:27:06,060 --> 00:27:11,342
Bugun birinchi kunim, shuning uchun biroz asabiy bo'lyapman.

528
00:27:11,366 --> 00:27:13,999
Hech qisiq emas.

529
00:27:14,022 --> 00:27:18,555
Hammamiz sizga mehribonlik bilan o'rgatamiz, xavotir olmang.

530
00:27:18,578 --> 00:27:20,312
Rahmat.

531
00:27:20,335 --> 00:27:25,335
Tanaka san, nega bu ko'ngilli faoliyatga qo'shildingiz?

532
00:27:25,357 --> 00:27:30,692
O'tgan oy bu shaharga ko'chib keldim.

533
00:27:30,716 --> 00:27:36,916
Mahalla faoliyatlariga qo'shilmoqchi edim va do'stlar orttirmoqchiman.

534
00:27:36,939 --> 00:27:39,415
Bu juda yaxshi!

535
00:27:39,438 --> 00:27:45,405
Bu bog'ga mahalla aholisi tez-tez sayr qilishadi.

536
00:27:45,428 --> 00:27:48,661
Bu bog' juda chiroyli ekan.

537
00:27:48,684 --> 00:27:50,617
Ha.

538
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:56,807
Lekin, dam olish kunlaridan keyin axlat va to'kilgan barglar ko'payadi.

539
00:27:56,830 --> 00:28:00,597
Bugungi ish mazmunini aytib bering.

540
00:28:00,620 --> 00:28:05,886
Bugun avval bog'dagi axlatni yig'amiz.

541
00:28:05,909 --> 00:28:10,946
Keyin skameykalar yonidagi barglarni to'playmiz.

542
00:28:10,970 --> 00:28:12,703
Tushunarli.

543
00:28:12,726 --> 00:28:15,770
Asboblar qayerda?

544
00:28:15,794 --> 00:28:19,286
U yerda ko'k qutida bor.

545
00:28:19,310 --> 00:28:23,643
Qo'lqop, qisqich va axlat qoplaridan foydalaning.

546
00:28:23,666 --> 00:28:25,266
Rahmat.

547
00:28:25,289 --> 00:28:29,022
Axlat qoplarini ajratamizmi?

548
00:28:29,045 --> 00:28:30,522
Ha.

549
00:28:30,546 --> 00:28:35,352
Yonuvchi axlat, qutilar va plastik butilkalarni ajratamiz.

550
00:28:35,375 --> 00:28:37,041
Tushunarli.

551
00:28:37,064 --> 00:28:38,998
E'tibor beraman.

552
00:28:39,021 --> 00:28:43,103
Ish taxminan bir soatda tugaydi.

553
00:28:43,127 --> 00:28:46,966
Ish tugagach, hammamiz birga choy ichamiz.

554
00:28:46,989 --> 00:28:49,479
Kutib qolaman.

555
00:28:49,502 --> 00:28:52,599
Bugun jonim bilan harakat qilaman.

556
00:28:52,622 --> 00:28:55,316
Birga harakat qilaylik!

557
00:28:55,340 --> 00:28:56,840
15-Sahna: Sur’atkashlik toʻgaragi kirish qismi / Sur’atkashlik toʻgaragiga kirish

558
00:28:56,840 --> 00:29:01,208
Salom. Sur’atkashlik toʻgaragimizga xush kelibsiz!

559
00:29:01,231 --> 00:29:02,731
16-Sahna: Poyezdda suhbat / Poyezdda suhbatlar

560
00:29:02,731 --> 00:29:04,531
Uzr, iltimos.

561
00:29:04,554 --> 00:29:07,954
Bu 10-B oʻrindiqmi?

562
00:29:07,977 --> 00:29:12,156
Ha, bu mening yonimdagi oʻrindiq.

563
00:29:12,180 --> 00:29:14,180
Rahmat.

564
00:29:14,203 --> 00:29:18,442
Yukimni ustidagi javonga qoʻyaman.

565
00:29:18,465 --> 00:29:20,299
Yordam beraymi?

566
00:29:20,322 --> 00:29:22,888
Bu yukingiz ogʻirmi?

567
00:29:22,911 --> 00:29:25,511
Yoʻq, muammo yoʻq.

568
00:29:25,534 --> 00:29:28,143
Gʻamxoʻrlik uchun raxmat.

569
00:29:28,167 --> 00:29:31,746
Bugun ob-havo juda yaxshi ekan, shunday emasmi?

570
00:29:31,769 --> 00:29:34,206
Qayerga ketayapsiz?

571
00:29:34,230 --> 00:29:37,104
Men Kiotoga boraman.

572
00:29:37,127 --> 00:29:40,294
Siz qayerga ketayapsiz?

573
00:29:40,317 --> 00:29:44,050
Men Shin-Osaka’ga boraman.

574
00:29:44,073 --> 00:29:45,507
Sayohatmisiz?

575
00:29:45,530 --> 00:29:47,808
Yo ish uchunmi?

576
00:29:47,831 --> 00:29:50,064
Sayohat.

577
00:29:50,087 --> 00:29:52,929
Kiotoda doʻstlarim bilan uchrashaman.

578
00:29:52,952 --> 00:29:54,486
Yaxshi fikr!

579
00:29:54,510 --> 00:29:58,077
Men ish uchun borayapman.

580
00:29:58,100 --> 00:30:00,233
Ishmi?

581
00:30:00,256 --> 00:30:02,123
Qiyin boʻladi-ku.

582
00:30:02,146 --> 00:30:05,316
Kiotoga tez-tez borasizmi?

583
00:30:05,339 --> 00:30:08,173
Yoʻq, ancha vaqtdan beri borolmagan edim.

584
00:30:08,196 --> 00:30:12,529
Kiotoda juda koʻp mazali taomlar bor.

585
00:30:12,552 --> 00:30:16,847
Ayniqsa, matcha muzqaymoq juda mashhur.

586
00:30:16,870 --> 00:30:21,044
Bekat yaqinida juda mazali doʻkon bor.

587
00:30:21,068 --> 00:30:23,406
Matcha muzqaymoqmi?

588
00:30:23,429 --> 00:30:25,996
Albatta, tatib koʻrmoqchiman.

589
00:30:26,019 --> 00:30:29,786
A, tez orada Kiotoga yetib qolamiz.

590
00:30:29,809 --> 00:30:33,079
Koʻp narsalarni aytib berganingiz uchun raxmat.

591
00:30:33,102 --> 00:30:36,201
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

592
00:30:36,225 --> 00:30:38,916
Sizga yoqimli sayohat tilayman.

593
00:30:38,939 --> 00:30:41,673
Ha, juda kutgandayman.

594
00:30:41,696 --> 00:30:44,555
Siz ham ishda omad tilayman.

595
00:30:44,578 --> 00:30:46,453
Kechirasiz.

596
00:30:46,477 --> 00:30:47,974
Rahmat.

597
00:30:47,997 --> 00:30:50,874
Ehtiyot boʻling.

598
00:30:50,897 --> 00:30:52,397
17-Sahna: Tanishuv suhbati / Birinchi uchrashuv: Salomlashish va kelib chiqish

599
00:30:52,397 --> 00:30:54,531
Yaxshiyamchi.

600
00:30:54,553 --> 00:30:57,443
Bu yerda oʻtirib boʻladi mi?

601
00:30:57,467 --> 00:30:59,355
Yaxshiyamchi.

602
00:30:59,378 --> 00:31:01,578
Ha, iltimos.

603
00:31:01,601 --> 00:31:03,482
Rahmat.

604
00:31:03,506 --> 00:31:06,752
Bu lounge juda chiroyli ekan-ku.

605
00:31:06,776 --> 00:31:08,514
Ha, rostdan ham.

606
00:31:08,537 --> 00:31:12,216
Juda tinch va qulay joy.

607
00:31:12,240 --> 00:31:15,527
Siz qayerdan kelgansiz?

608
00:31:15,550 --> 00:31:18,801
Men AQShdan kelganman.

609
00:31:18,824 --> 00:31:22,102
Siz qayerdan kelgansiz?

610
00:31:22,126 --> 00:31:25,175
Men Tailanddan kelganman.

611
00:31:25,199 --> 00:31:28,599
Yaponiya’ga qachon yetib keldingiz?

612
00:31:28,622 --> 00:31:31,793
Kecha kechqurun yetib keldim.

613
00:31:31,816 --> 00:31:34,673
Bu yerda uch kun turaman.

614
00:31:34,696 --> 00:31:36,496
Shundaymi?

615
00:31:36,519 --> 00:31:40,919
Men bugundan boshlab toʻrt kun turaman.

616
00:31:40,942 --> 00:31:43,875
Bugun qayerga bordingiz?

617
00:31:43,898 --> 00:31:47,898
Bugun yaqin atrofdagi ibodatxonaga bordim.

618
00:31:47,921 --> 00:31:52,455
Juda qadimiy ibodatxonada go‘zal edi.

619
00:31:52,478 --> 00:31:54,344
Yaxshi fikr!

620
00:31:54,367 --> 00:31:58,637
Men vokzal yaqinida xarid qildim.

621
00:31:58,661 --> 00:32:02,095
Ertaga qayerga borishni rejalashtiryapsiz?

622
00:32:02,118 --> 00:32:06,962
Ertaga ertalabdan boshlab mashhur qal’aga boramiz.

623
00:32:06,985 --> 00:32:09,392
Siz qayerga borasiz?

624
00:32:09,415 --> 00:32:14,828
Ertaga katta bog‘ va muzeyni ziyorat qilamiz.

625
00:32:14,852 --> 00:32:19,818
Muzeyning yonida mazali ramen do‘koni bor ekan.

626
00:32:19,842 --> 00:32:21,775
Rostdanmi?

627
00:32:21,798 --> 00:32:24,998
Men ham ramen yoqtiraman.

628
00:32:25,021 --> 00:32:27,233
Borib koʻrmoqchiman.

629
00:32:27,257 --> 00:32:32,031
A, u yerda issiq choy bor ekan.

630
00:32:32,054 --> 00:32:34,787
Bepul ichishingiz mumkin.

631
00:32:34,810 --> 00:32:37,418
Yaxshi ekan.

632
00:32:37,442 --> 00:32:40,017
Choy quyaymi?

633
00:32:40,041 --> 00:32:41,641
Rahmat.

634
00:32:41,664 --> 00:32:43,198
Iltimos.

635
00:32:43,221 --> 00:32:45,587
Kutib turgizdim.

636
00:32:45,610 --> 00:32:48,178
Issiq ko‘k choy.

637
00:32:48,202 --> 00:32:50,018
Rahmat.

638
00:32:50,041 --> 00:32:52,850
Juda mazali choy ekan.

639
00:32:52,873 --> 00:32:57,325
Choy ichib, sayohat rejalarimiz haqida gaplashamizmi?

640
00:32:57,349 --> 00:33:00,118
Ha, shunday qilamiz.

641
00:33:00,141 --> 00:33:01,641
18-sahna: Birinchi marta piyoda sayr / First Time Hiking

642
00:33:01,641 --> 00:33:03,721
Xayrli tong!

643
00:33:03,744 --> 00:33:05,811
Tanishganimdan xursandman.

644
00:33:05,834 --> 00:33:07,838
Xayrli tong!

645
00:33:07,861 --> 00:33:09,676
Tanishganimdan xursandman.

646
00:33:09,699 --> 00:33:11,784
Tanaka.

647
00:33:11,807 --> 00:33:14,691
Men to‘garak rahbari Yamada.

648
00:33:14,714 --> 00:33:17,548
Bugun sizga ishonaman.

649
00:33:17,571 --> 00:33:21,371
Men ham, iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

650
00:33:21,394 --> 00:33:24,997
Piyoda sayr to‘garagiga xush kelibsiz!

651
00:33:25,020 --> 00:33:29,278
Tanaka-san, piyoda sayr qilish tajribangiz bormi?

652
00:33:29,302 --> 00:33:32,760
Yo‘q, deyarli yo‘q.

653
00:33:32,783 --> 00:33:36,383
Baland tog‘larga chiqish mening uchun birinchi marta.

654
00:33:36,406 --> 00:33:38,839
Tushunarli.

655
00:33:38,862 --> 00:33:42,343
Bugungi tog‘ pastroq tog‘.

656
00:33:42,367 --> 00:33:46,500
Yo‘l ham yurishga qulay, xavotir olmang.

657
00:33:46,523 --> 00:33:48,656
Yaxshi boʻldi.

658
00:33:48,679 --> 00:33:50,879
Biroz tinchlandim.

659
00:33:50,902 --> 00:33:55,036
Yo‘lga chiqishdan oldin jihozlarni tekshirib olamiz.

660
00:33:55,059 --> 00:33:58,325
Kiygan poyabzalingizni ko‘rsating.

661
00:33:58,348 --> 00:34:01,395
Ha, mana bu poyabzal.

662
00:34:01,418 --> 00:34:04,785
Mustahkam sport poyabzali kiyib keldim.

663
00:34:04,808 --> 00:34:06,987
Yaxshi poyabzal ekan.

664
00:34:07,011 --> 00:34:10,144
Bular bilan sirpanmaydi.

665
00:34:10,167 --> 00:34:14,181
Keyin, yomg‘ir kiyimi olganmisiz?

666
00:34:14,205 --> 00:34:18,039
Ha, ryukzakimga yomg‘ir paltosini solib qo‘ydim.

667
00:34:18,062 --> 00:34:20,229
Ajoyib!

668
00:34:20,252 --> 00:34:24,907
Tog‘ ob-havosi tez o‘zgaradi, shuning uchun muhim.

669
00:34:24,930 --> 00:34:28,597
Suv yoki choy yetarli miqdorda bormi?

670
00:34:28,620 --> 00:34:33,620
Ha, 500 millilitrli plastik butilka ikkita bor.

671
00:34:33,643 --> 00:34:35,919
Yetarli.

672
00:34:35,942 --> 00:34:39,362
Tushlik uchun ovqat ham olganmisiz?

673
00:34:39,385 --> 00:34:43,962
Ha, yo‘lda do‘kondan onigiri sotib oldim.

674
00:34:43,985 --> 00:34:47,385
Tayyorgarlik mukammal ekan.

675
00:34:47,408 --> 00:34:51,842
Bugungi marshrutga chiqish uchun ikki soat ketadi.

676
00:34:51,865 --> 00:34:55,243
Sekin-asta dam olib chiqamiz.

677
00:34:55,266 --> 00:34:59,278
Yo‘lda charchagan bo‘lsangiz, darhol aytib turing.

678
00:34:59,302 --> 00:35:01,435
Ha, rahmat.

679
00:35:01,458 --> 00:35:04,896
Boshqalarga yuk bo‘lmaslik uchun harakat qilaman.

680
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:07,387
Hech qisiq emas.

681
00:35:07,410 --> 00:35:09,743
Hammamiz bir-birimizga yordam beramiz.

682
00:35:09,766 --> 00:35:13,299
Bugun xavfsizlik birinchi o‘rinda bo‘lsin.

683
00:35:13,322 --> 00:35:15,941
Endi, yo‘lga chiqamiz!

684
00:35:15,965 --> 00:35:19,331
Ha, iltimos, rahbarlik qiling!

685
00:35:19,354 --> 00:35:20,854
19-Sahna: Kulolchilikka ilk qadam / Kulolchilikda birinchi qadamlar

686
00:35:20,854 --> 00:35:27,588
Salom, kulolchilik darsiga xush kelibsiz! Men oʻqituvchi Yamada.

687
00:35:27,611 --> 00:35:31,046
Salom, men Tanakaman.

688
00:35:31,069 --> 00:35:33,742
Bugun sizga ishonaman.

689
00:35:33,766 --> 00:35:36,299
Iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

690
00:35:36,322 --> 00:35:40,922
Tanaka-siz, kulolchilikni birinchi marta sinab koʻryapsizmi?

691
00:35:40,945 --> 00:35:43,813
Ha, birinchi marta.

692
00:35:43,837 --> 00:35:46,804
Men bu ishni juda ham qilishni xohlardim.

693
00:35:46,827 --> 00:35:50,060
Rostdanmi? Bu menga juda yoqdi.

694
00:35:50,083 --> 00:35:54,083
Bugun qanday asar yasamoqchisiz?

695
00:35:54,106 --> 00:35:58,473
Kundalik foydalanadigan chashka yasamoqchiman.

696
00:35:58,495 --> 00:36:01,311
Sal kamroq kattaroqini yasash yaxshi boʻlardi.

697
00:36:01,334 --> 00:36:03,101
Yaxshi fikr!

698
00:36:03,124 --> 00:36:06,290
Ajoyib chashka yasaymiz!

699
00:36:06,313 --> 00:36:10,080
Avvalo, qoʻllaringizni toza yuvib oling.

700
00:36:10,103 --> 00:36:12,921
Ha, yuvib keldim.

701
00:36:12,944 --> 00:36:16,611
Endi, bu loydan foydalanamiz.

702
00:36:16,634 --> 00:36:20,602
Avval, loyni yumaloq qilib qovuring.

703
00:36:20,626 --> 00:36:22,519
Tushunarli.

704
00:36:22,542 --> 00:36:25,542
Qoʻlim bilan yumaloq qilib siqaman.

705
00:36:25,565 --> 00:36:27,654
Juda yaxshi chiqdi!

706
00:36:27,678 --> 00:36:32,445
Keyin, buni charxga qoʻying.

707
00:36:32,467 --> 00:36:37,909
Qoʻlingizga koʻp suv olib, pedallarni bosib charxni aylantiring.

708
00:36:37,933 --> 00:36:39,700
Tushunarli.

709
00:36:39,723 --> 00:36:41,889
Suv oldim.

710
00:36:41,912 --> 00:36:45,746
Bosh barmogʻingiz bilan markaziga teshik ochib koʻring.

711
00:36:45,769 --> 00:36:49,303
Ha, sekin bosib koʻrayapman.

712
00:36:49,326 --> 00:36:52,493
A, teshik ochildi!

713
00:36:52,516 --> 00:36:54,533
Ajoyib!

714
00:36:54,556 --> 00:36:59,323
Ikkala qoʻlingiz bilan ushlab, sekin yuqoriga choʻzib chiqing.

715
00:36:59,346 --> 00:37:02,622
Ha, sekin choʻzaman.

716
00:37:02,646 --> 00:37:06,525
Asta-sekin chashka shakliga kirdi.

717
00:37:06,548 --> 00:37:09,481
Juda ham chiroyli shakl chiqdi!

718
00:37:09,504 --> 00:37:14,560
Tag qismini tekislab… tayyor!

719
00:37:14,583 --> 00:37:18,425
Pishguncha qancha vaqt ketadi?

720
00:37:18,449 --> 00:37:21,548
Taxminan bir oy ketadi.

721
00:37:21,571 --> 00:37:25,838
Tayyor boʻlgach, sizning uyingizga yetkazib beramiz.

722
00:37:25,861 --> 00:37:28,066
Kutishni intiqlik bilan kutaman.

723
00:37:28,089 --> 00:37:32,538
Bugun meni shunchalik yaxshi oʻrgatganingiz uchun rahmat.

724
00:37:32,561 --> 00:37:36,295
Yoʻq, biz ham sizga rahmat.

725
00:37:36,317 --> 00:37:39,613
Qachon kelishni istasangiz, kelishingiz mumkin.

726
00:37:39,637 --> 00:37:42,331
Ha, yana kelaman!